roboparty-inference (1.3.2-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Validate /joy, /cmd_vel and interrupt joint targets for minimum length and
    finite values instead of indexing or accepting invalid input.
  * Expire cached velocity commands after cmd_timeout_s (default 0.2 s), and
    clear the command when switching between joy and /cmd_vel ownership.
  * Stop bundling ONNX Runtime; depend on roboparty-onnxruntime instead to
    avoid overwriting /opt/roboparty/lib/libonnxruntime.so.1.0.

 -- RoboParty <2321901849@qq.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0800

